- Use modular Python architecture
- Separate reasoning, execution, and API layers
- Always return structured JSON (no free-form strings as primary output)
- Keep reasoning (LLM) isolated to `app/utils/llm_utils.py` and `app/core/reasoning.py`
- Keep execution side-effects isolated to `app/services/executor.py` and notification to `app/services/notifier.py`
- Prefer deterministic rules for safety-critical gating (confidence thresholds, retry vs escalate)
- Avoid hardcoding brittle one-off strings; use small pattern detectors + RAG + reasoning
- Use environment variables for configs
